# autorhythm: the M254, whose twelve outputs are MOSTLY accompaniment (eight of them feed the M251
# chord/bass chip, doc §4e), so this is the widest machine on the dial: 12 lanes over 32 states.
# Six presses of ] reach it, then run.
tap 12 ]
tap 20 ]
tap 28 ]
tap 36 ]
tap 44 ]
tap 52 ]
tap 66 SPACE
